  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I2Iecc2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"331\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customizable-elytra-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.12.2 回溯版&nbsp;by jbredwards</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">允许像皮革盔甲和盾牌一样，对鞘翅进行染色和放置旗帜</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/65w3fye.gif\" width=\"352\" height=\"166\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nabKwkn.gif\" width=\"352\" height=\"166\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iRmFHSt.gif\" width=\"338\" height=\"422\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.20 新增：支持盔甲纹饰！</span></h3><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n9bnpIO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"349\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">附加功能与常见问题</span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">与披风兼容！</span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tQ75HRc.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"422\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（你也可以通过将披风与一张纸合成，来隐藏它在鞘翅上的显示！）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>与荧光墨囊合成，让鞘翅在黑暗中发光！</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O8f3qxP.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">（在 1.16 版本中，也兼容 Upgrade Aquatic 和 Caves & Cliffs 回溯版的荧光墨囊！）</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">常见问题</h3>\n<h5><strong>这个模组是否兼容其他模组添加的旗帜？</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">截至目前的最新版本，以下模组已兼容：Additional Banners、Rats、Ice and Fire、Autumnity、Buzzier Bees、Neapolitan、Alex's Mobs 和 Penguin-Lib</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如果我对鞘翅进行自定义，附魔/自定义名称会保留吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">会，你对鞘翅所做的任何修改在自定义后都会保留</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如何移除自定义效果？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以手持鞘翅对着装有水的炼药锅右击，将其变回普通的鞘翅！</span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">视频</span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5AR9YOdEBL4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p9s6mwcfayU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（如果时间戳无效，请跳转到3:06！）</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
